<BRK/>
[<ITM><SUB>Sample Textured Wall Coating System Mock-Up</SUB>; <SUB>G<TAI OPT="ARMY">, [_____]</TAI></SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
]<LST><SUB>SD-07 Certificates</SUB></LST><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<ITM><SUB>Qualification Testing</SUB> laboratory for coatings; <SUB>G<TAI OPT="ARMY">, [_____]</TAI></SUB></ITM><BRK/>
<BRK/>
