<NTE><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/>
<NPR>NOTE:  Use MPI 72 in severe environments for a durable, glossy appearance.  Use latex systems where MPI 20, MPI 
101, or MPI 108 is not allowed.  MPI 72, urethane is allowed in California.  For selection of top coats, use the 
first bracketed option for geographic areas that do not have harsh environmental conditions.  Use the second bracketed 
option for areas that have harsh corrosive environments.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
