applications, refer to Section <SRF>09 96 59</SRF> HIGH-BUILD GLAZE COATINGS.  These high performance coatings are used for 
exposure-resistant requirements and can be applied to wood, metal, and concrete substrates.</NPR><BRK/>
<AST/><BRK/></NTE>
